PART 15 — PERFORMANCE AND TECHNICAL SAFETY
The phone must not slow down the game.
Requirements:
* Generate social content only when necessary.
* Avoid excessive React re-renders.
* Limit feed history.
* Use pagination or incremental feed loading.
* Avoid storing duplicate event-derived posts.
* Batch state updates.
* Use stable IDs.
* Keep financial calculations outside UI components.
* Avoid generating social content during rendering.
Suggested initial history limits:
* Twitter: 300 posts.
* News: 150 articles.
* Messenger: 100 recent messages per conversation.
* Instagram: 150 posts.
* YouTube: 100 videos.
Older content can be archived or pruned using controlled retention rules.
 
