FINAL DESIGN PRINCIPLE
Life Empire should feel like an esports world that continues living even when the player is not actively managing it.
A tournament victory should create celebrations.
A defeat should create criticism.
A transfer should create speculation.
A controversy should create discussions.
A superstar should attract sponsorships.
An organisation in financial trouble should experience falling confidence and potentially falling stock prices.
A rising amateur should be able to become the biggest name in the industry.
The phone is not just an interface. It is the player’s window into the entire esports universe.
